✱252.  SEGMENTS OF WELL-ORDERED SERIES.

Summary of ✱252.

The properties of sections and segments are greatly simplified in the case of
series which are well-ordered, owing to the fact that every proper section has
a sequent.  The most useful propositions in this number are those transcribed
below.
PM-VERBATIM-END PM3:STAR252-SUMMARY-P27 -/

